@model Imobisoft.Search.Web.ImobisoftSearchListingViewModel
@* Everything a site needs, in one drop-in block: filters above the search box from the moment
   the page opens, results, spelling suggestions and Load More - all driven by the profile
   configured in the backoffice.

   The markup itself lives in Views/Partials/Search/listing.cshtml, which the package's own search
   page renders too - one copy, so the embedded component and the built-in page cannot drift, and
   the profile's theme applies to both at once.

   A site takes over the whole component by creating
   Views/Shared/Components/ImobisoftSearchListing/Default.cshtml in its own project, or replaces
   just one piece by dropping in Views/Partials/Search/results.cshtml (or filters, noresults,
   loadmore, searchbar, styles). *@
<partial name="~/Views/Partials/Search/listing.cshtml" model="Model" />
